Jersey Boys is a music, drama film directed by Clint Eastwood.

3
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:26,000
A musical biopic of the Four Seasons—the rise, the tough times and personal clashes, and the
ultimate triumph of a group of friends whose music became symbolic of a generation.

4
00:29:46,666 --> 00:29:52,666
Far from a mere tribute concert, it gets to the heart of the relationships at the centre of the group,
with a special focus on frontman Frankie Valli, the small kid with the big falsetto.

