11
01:21:53,333 --> 01:21:59,333
Jersey Boys is a 2014 American  musical drama film directed and produced by Clint
Eastwood, based on the 2004 Tony Award-winning jukebox musical of the same name.

12
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:26,000
The film tells the story of the musical group The Four Seasons.

13
01:36:46,666 --> 01:36:52,666
Original band members Frankie Valli and Bob Gaudio (who also
composed the film's music) were executive producers.

14
01:44:13,333 --> 01:44:19,333
Jersey Boys was released in the United States on June 20, 2014.

15
01:51:40,000 --> 01:51:46,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the musical numbers but
criticized the narrative and runtime, and grossed $67 million worldwide.

